{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythm-Driven Combat\uff1a</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All attacks, defenses, and skill activations must follow the musical beat. Hitting notes with precision grants bonus damage and special effects, while mistiming leaves players vulnerable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike Build System\uff1a</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each run, players collect and combine a variety of shared gear and legendary artifacts to create unique combat builds. Repeating the same items allows for tier upgrades, unlocking stronger effects and synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Progression &amp; Development\uff1a</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successfully completing levels unlocks new characters, items, and exclusive skills\u2014supporting different rhythm styles and combat approaches to deepen replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized Maps &amp; Enemy Encounters\uff1a</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run features procedurally generated maps, enemy combinations, and loot drops, ensuring every playthrough is a fresh challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Fights &amp; Crisis Escalation\uff1a</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each major stage ends with a powerful boss featuring unique rhythmic attack patterns and multi-phase mechanics. Victory requires adaptation, precision, and mastery of the beat.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3496150?t=1760425316","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3496150?t=1760425316","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_